ily see which window is using X11; the eyes move if the window is X11, they stay still otherwise.\nI use Kate as a control variable, just showing that the issue doesn't happen when using a Wayland window.\n\n###### Video may look bad, but I had to do some black magic to get this thing within 10 MB. It's AV1 in WebM; it may not be viewable on some devices.\n\nEdit: forgot to reiterate: it does not happen when pressing the minimize button for me; it only happens when minimizing through the task manager.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b66305af-cc96-4538-9b1a-24d1b2d9fe65","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2753190757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3336787459","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103978#issuecomment-3336787459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103978","id":3336787459,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G41YD","user":{"login":"sancho2","id":20851686,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODUxNjg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20851686?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2","html_url":"https://github.com/sancho2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sancho2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api